  "title": "Caramel Ham Loaf",
  "description": "Ground ham and beef are baked with a brown sugar glaze, making a delicious and easy main dish. This recipe was a favorite in my catering and restaurant business. Ground ham, ground beef, eggs, bread, brown sugar and mustard.",
